  "term": "NSAID",
  "definition": "NSAID stands for nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drug. In this source, it refers to an over-the-counter medicine that is widely used, but regular or long-term use is advised against for many people with chronic kidney disease, heart failure, or hypertension because of increased risk of harm.",
